# Keep the build context small. Do NOT exclude any `crates/**` source — they are
# root-workspace members and cargo needs them all to build `-p bulwark-server`.
.git
.github
*.log
/models
# Detached sub-workspaces not needed to build the SERVER tier…
apps
platform
# …but the research-site image (deploy/research/Dockerfile) DOES need
# apps/research, so re-include just that one. (`**/target` is re-applied last so
# the bulky build artifacts still never enter any context.)
!apps/research
!apps/research/**
**/target
